  "question": {
    "text": "How many electrons are involved in the following redox reaction ?<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>Cr</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msubsup> <mtext>O</mtext> <mn>7</mn> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mo>-</mo> </mrow> </msubsup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>Fe</mtext> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mo>+</mo> </mrow> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msubsup> <mtext>O</mtext> <mn>4</mn> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mo>-</mo> </mrow> </msubsup> <mo>&#8594;</mo> <msup> <mtext>Cr</mtext> <mn>3 +</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>Fe</mtext> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mo>+</mo> </mrow> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>CO</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;(Unbalanced)"
  },
